div.p:
(1) U.S. air operations in Cambodia, and (2) future South Vietnamese operations in Cambodia. I suggest you begin by calling on each of the following for about ten minutes each:
—General Wheeler for a rundown on sanctuary operations;
—Director Helms for enemy reactions.

list.item:
—U.S. tactical air strikes to be conducted against enemy tactical and
                        logistics targets in Cambodia to limit enemy capability to resupply forces
                        which could threaten U.S. and allied units in South Vietnam;
